## The surface: the building, the forest paths and the lake.

## Room 1. LOOK.BAS 100 and 150.

create the Building
  a room
  room name:
    Building
  exits, one-way: east to the Outside Building, down to the Basement, out to the Outside Building

  passage to the Outside Building
    grammar
      door
  end passage

  You are in a one-room building.Stairs lead down.

## Room 2. LOOK.BAS 200 and 250.

create the Basement
  a room
  room name:
    Basement
  exits, one-way: up to the Building
  north is blocked: door-is-closed
  in is blocked: door-is-closed
  out is blocked: door-is-closed

  passage to the Basement
    grammar
      door
    blocked: door-is-closed
  end passage

  This is the basement of the building.To the north is a great door{br}
  which appears to be locked from the other side.

## Room 3. LOOK.BAS 300 and 350.

create the Path
  a room
  room name:
    Path
  exits, one-way: north to the Forest 7, east to the Lake Shore, west to the Cave Enterance, south to the Outside Building

  You are on a path which winds through the forest.The path{br}
  here bends from south to west.

## Room 4. LOOK.BAS 400 and 450.

create the Cave Enterance
  a room
  room name:
    cave enterance
  exits, one-way: north to the Tunnel, south to the Path, down to the Tunnel, in to the Tunnel, out to the Path

  The path here goes into a cave tunnel.It exits to the south.

## Room 5. LOOK.BAS 500 and 550.

create the Cave Exit
  a room
  room name:
    cave exit
  exits, one-way: north to the Outside Building, east to the Forest 7, west to the Path, south to the Forest 6
  up is blocked: cant-get-up-ramp
  down is blocked: cant-get-up-ramp
  in is blocked: cant-get-up-ramp

  You are in the forest.To the west is the exit to a cave,{br}
  with a steep ramp preventing entry into the cave.

## Room 6. LOOK.BAS 600 and 650.

create the Forest 6
  a room
  room name:
    Forest.
  exits, one-way: north to the Lake Shore, east to the Cave Exit, west to the Outside Building, south to the Forest 7

  you are in a dense forest, with trees all around.

## Room 7. LOOK.BAS 700 and 750.

create the Forest 7
  a room
  room name:
    Forest.
  exits, one-way: north to the Path, east to the Forest 7, west to the Cave Exit, south to the Forest 6

  you are in a dense forest, with trees all around.

## Room 8. LOOK.BAS 800 and 850.

create the Outside Building
  a room
  room name:
    Outside building
  exits, one-way: north to the Path, east to the Forest 6, west to the Building, south to the Cave Exit, in to the Building

  passage to the Building
    grammar
      door
  end passage

  you are on a path which winds north into a dense forest.{br}
  The west end of the path goes into a small building.

## Room 9. LOOK.BAS 900 and 950.

create the Lake Shore
  a room
  room name:
    Lake shore
  exits, one-way: west to the Path, south to the Forest 6
  north is blocked: drown-yourself
  east is blocked: drown-yourself
  northeast is blocked: drown-yourself
  down is blocked: drown-yourself
  in is blocked: drown-yourself

  You are on the southwest shore of a small lake.
